  "ayahs": [
    {
      "number": 5242,
      "text": "Blessed is He in Whose Hand is the dominion, and He is Most Capable of all things.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 1,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5243,
      "text": "Who created death and life to test you as to which of you is best in deeds, and He is the All-Mighty, the Most Forgiving.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5244,
      "text": "Who created seven heavens one above another; you will not see any imperfection[1] in the creation of the Most Compassionate. Look again; can you see any flaw?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5245,
      "text": "Then look again and again; your sight will turn back to you humbled and weary.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5246,
      "text": "We have adorned the lowest heaven with lamps and have made them as missiles to stone the devils[2], and We have prepared for them the punishment of the Blazing Fire.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5247,
      "text": "For those who disbelieve in their Lord there will be the punishment of Hell. What a terrible destination!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5248,
      "text": "When they are thrown in it, they will hear its roaring as it boils up,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5249,
      "text": "almost bursting in fury. Every time a group is thrown in it, its keepers will ask them, “Did there not come to you a warner?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5250,
      "text": "They will say, “Yes, a warner did come to us, but we denied and said, ‘Allah has not sent down anything; you are greatly misguided.’”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5251,
      "text": "And they will say, “If only we had listened or understood, we would not be among the dwellers of the Blazing Fire.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5252,
      "text": "Thus they will confess their sins. So away[3] with the dwellers of the Blazing Fire!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
        "numberOfAyahs": 30,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 29,
      "manzil": 7,
      "page": 562,
      "ruku": 496,
      "hizbQuarter": 225,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 5253,
      "text": "Indeed, those who fear their Lord unseen will have forgiveness and a great reward.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 67,
        "name": "سُورَةُ المُلۡكِ",
        "englishName": "Al-Mulk",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Sovereignty",
